# Supabase security

- Row Level Security stays enabled. Do not disable it for local convenience.
- A user reads and writes only their own athlete rows (`auth.uid()` / `athlete_id`).
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` is server/seed only. Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, never a Client Component.
- Schema changes go through a new file in `supabase/migrations/`. Do not edit applied migrations in place.
- `exercise-media` stays a private bucket. Object paths stay prefixed with the user id.
- Local `supabase db reset` must never use `--linked`.
